o-profile\">\n        <img src=\"images/profile.jpg\" class=\"profile-photo\" alt=\"Portrait of Carlos Trujillo\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\">\n        <p class=\"profile-affiliation\">Leading research at <a href=\"https://www.pymc-labs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PyMC Labs</a><br><span>Bayesian inference · Causal modeling</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-bottom\"><a href=\"#selected-writing\" class=\"hero-scroll\">A few things I've been thinking about <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"home-motion-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Background animation controls\">\n    <span class=\"motion-label\" data-dag-hint>An illustrative causal field</span>\n    <div class=\"dag-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-dag-pulse hidden>Send a pulse <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-dag-toggle hidden>Pause motion</button></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"page-section\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-writing\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Notes from the work</p><h2 id=\"selected-writing\">Questions worth<br>spending time on.</h2></div><a class=\"home-see-all\" href=\"articles.html\">All articles <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n    <div class=\"home-cards\">\n      <article class=\"home-card\">\n        <p class=\"home-card-meta\"><time datetime=\"2026-07\">July 2026</time> <span>PyTensor · LLM</span></p>\n        <h3><a href=\"articles/alchemize_pytensor_mlx_gemma_3n/alchemize_pytensor_mlx_gemma_3n.html\">PyTensor beyond PyMC <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3>\n        <p>An inspectable local-LLM stack with one symbolic graph compiled through C, Numba, and MLX.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"home-card\">\n        <p class=\"home-card-meta\"><time datetime=\"2026-04\">April 2026</time> <span>Bayesian · Causal</span></p>\n        <h3><a href=\"articles/placebo_bayesian_quasi_experiments/placebo_bayesian_quasi_experiments.html\">Can you trust your quasi-experiment? <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3>\n        <p>Placebo tests and Bayesian inference for a harder question: does your causal estimate hold up?</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"home-contact-strip\"><p>Ideas are better in conversation.</p><div><a href=\"talks.html\">Talks &amp; presentations <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a> <a href=\"mailto:carlos.trujillo.agostini@gmail.com\">Get in touch <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"js/hero-dag.js\"></script>"}],"schema_version":4,"source":"index.qmd"}